{
 "version": 1,
 "about": "Shared contract of the LLM usage normalizers (Engine llmusage, nozle-js, nozle-python, nozle-go). usage: provider response body in, totals/breakdowns/buckets out. Totals are inclusive (input_tokens counts cached, cache-write, audio and image input; output_tokens counts reasoning, audio and image output); breakdowns not listed in expect are 0; buckets are the disjoint non-zero parts and sum to the totals. Clamp order: input side cached, cache_write, cache_write_1h, audio, image; output side reasoning, audio, image; each bounded by what remains. streams: SSE in, final usage out, plus whether the provider's final marker was seen and the delivered text bytes. aborted: a cut stream; the usage to bill (bill=false: no event), usage_source, and the estimator rules: input = reported, else ceil(request_text_bytes/4); output = reported, else ceil(delivered bytes/4); Anthropic output = max(reported, estimate) and usage_source estimated when the estimate won.",
